<String id="16000291" name="Flying Skill: Nightlion" gender="Common" race="Common" tooltip="$H_S_GOODSpeed 280. Flying 280, OP 538.$COLOR_END$BR$BR$COLOR_ENDA black sky lion (MP, HP) with 280 movement speed and 280 flight speed.$COLOR_END$BR$H_S_GOODRecovers HP and MP." class="Common" />
<String id="200200" name="Inescapable Doom II" gender="Common" race="Common" tooltip="&lt;font color = '#00A0FF'&gt;[Effect]&lt;/font&gt;$BRBriefly slows movement of targets within 5m radius by 62%.$BR$BR&lt;font color = '#00A0FF'&gt;[PvP]&lt;/font&gt;$BRPrevents other players from using evasive and movement skills.$BR$BR&lt;font color = '#00A0FF'&gt;[Skill Usage]&lt;/font&gt;$BRUse the skill button before attacking a quick-moving enemy.$BR$BR&lt;font color = '#00A0FF'&gt;[Chain Skill Guide]&lt;/font&gt;$BRWhile &lt;font color = '#F9B600'&gt;Intimidation&lt;/font&gt; is active with &lt;font color = '#F9B600'&gt;Bloodlust Mock&lt;/font&gt; skill advancement, enrages all monsters within 10m and increases your &lt;font color = '#66bbff'&gt;aggro&lt;/font&gt;, but cooldown increases to 5 min." class="Berserker" />
<String id="200201" name="Infuriate" gender="Common" race="Common" tooltip="&lt;font color = '#00A0FF'&gt;[Effect]&lt;/font&gt;$BREnrages all monsters within 10m, forcing them to attack you, and sharply increases your &lt;font color = '#66bbff'&gt;aggro&lt;/font&gt;.$BR$BR&lt;font color = '#00A0FF'&gt;[Skill Usage]&lt;/font&gt;$BRAvailable only while &lt;font color = '#F9B600'&gt;Intimidation&lt;/font&gt; is active. Replaces &lt;font color = '#F9B600'&gt;Inescapable Doom&lt;/font&gt; with the &lt;font color = '#F9B600'&gt;Bloodlust: Mock&lt;/font&gt; skill advancement." class="Berserker" />
<String id="240100" name="Volley of Curses I" gender="Common" race="Common" tooltip="&lt;font color = '#00A0FF'&gt;[Affected Effect]&lt;/font&gt;$BRLock on up to 4 targets within 27m and inflict a curse that does $value(+$calcValue(multiple,1002,1,0)) damage every $tickInterval for $time.$BRPeriodic damage is increased by $H_S_GOOD100%$COLOR_END of your Magic Amplification.$BR&lt;font color = '#00A0FF'&gt;[PvP]&lt;/font&gt; Deals 1212$calcValue(multiple,1002,0.03,0) to other players.$BRStacks up to 3 times.$BRDecreases Magic and Physical Resistance of target by $calcValue(multiple,1004,0.3,3).$BRThis effect is increased by $H_S_GOOD30%$COLOR_END of your Magic Resistance.$BR$BR&lt;font color = '#00A0FF'&gt;[Skill Usage]&lt;/font&gt;Press the skill button once and move over to lock on to targets, then press the skill button again or left-click to shoot at all targets." class="Elementalist" />
<String id="290900" name="Triple Nemesis IX" gender="Common" race="Common" tooltip="&lt;font color = '#00A0FF'&gt;[Effect]&lt;/font&gt;$BRThrow energy pulses at a target up to $maxDistance away.$BR&lt;font color = '#66bbff'&gt;Holding or repeatedly pressing&lt;/font&gt; the skill button generates up to three pulses.$BR&lt;font color = '#00A0FF'&gt;[PvP]&lt;/font&gt;$BRReduced damage at max distance.$BR$BR&lt;font color = '#00A0FF'&gt;[Affected Effect]&lt;/font&gt;$BRDecreases Magic and Physical Resistance of target by $calcValue(multiple,1004,0.3,3) on successful hit.$BRThis effect is increased by $H_S_GOOD30%$COLOR_END of your Magic Resistance.$BR$BR[Skill Usage]&lt;/font&gt;Use to damage 1 to 3 distant enemies." class="Priest" />
